    "detailed_description": "Lord of Demons is a fantasy-third person action-tactics game where you control demons, cast mighty spells and fulfill evil objectives to conquer islands.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> cast mighty elemental spells, different enemies have different weaknesses<br></li><li> control your army strategically<br></li><li> use oil barrels, the mine spell and more to build traps - then lure your enemies into them<br></li><li> complete various evil missions to take over islands (destroy towers, capture humans, kill enemy generals, raise undeads, ..)<br></li><li> destroy buildings for loot<br></li><li> invest in upgrades to become the ultimate lord<br></li><li> conquer procedurally generated islands</li></ul>",
